{"availability":"available","full":"RauhanAhmed/FinancialAnalystAIAgent","name":"FinancialAnalystAIAgent","description":"Agentic AI–driven stock analytics leveraging Phidata, Google Gemini 2.0 Flash, and Yahoo Finance. Features real-time data, interactive Plotly charts, and a Streamlit dashboard for comprehensive, actionable market insights.","category":"Finance","language":"Python","stars":7,"forks":5,"created":"2025-02-22T15:21:20Z","updated":"2025-05-29T09:56:48Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://financialanalystaiagent.streamlit.app","topics":["agentic-ai","data-visualization","finance","google-gemini","investment","phidata","plotly","stock-analysis","streamlit","yfinance"],"demo":"https://financialanalystaiagent.streamlit.app/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T16:32:59.827Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-06T16:32:59.827Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-06T16:32:59.827Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T16:32:59.827Z","stars":7,"forks":5}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["An advanced, AI-powered financial analysis tool that combines market data retrieval, technical charting, and natural language insights. This project leverages cutting-edge technologies and frameworks to deliver sophisticated analyses, actionable recommendations, and comprehensive market insights—all within an interactive dashboard.","This project provides a complete solution for stock analysis by integrating historical market data, interactive visualizations, and AI-driven insights. At its core is the Financial Analyst Agent, which leverages the power of Google Gemini 2.0 Flash to process user queries, assess market trends, and generate clear, actionable recommendations. The accompanying Streamlit dashboard offers an intuitive user interface to explore stock data, visualize candlestick charts, and interact with the AI agent."],"features":["Real-Time Stock Data: Integrates with Yahoo Finance to fetch up-to-date ma